  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3108.01 General Rule",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3108.01 General Rule. All DERs used to:\n\n(a) Meet NSR offset requirements shall comply with the requirements of section 173 of the Act and 40 CFR 51.165(a) including the requirements of Env-A 3108.02.\n\n(b) Meet conformity requirements shall comply with 40 CFR part 51, subparts T and W and part 93 subparts A and B.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3100.html"
